<title>USA: IMM currency futures mixed in light late trade.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures mixed in light late trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 1 - IMM currency futures were mixed in light late trade. Sept marks fell to $0.5753, near the contract low of $0.5750. Treasury's Summers said the dollar was &quot;in a very strong position&quot; and that financial markets would be fine if U.S. maintained solid fundamentals.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
